{"about_the_game":"I am a <strong>solo dev </strong>that have been making games with passion for years, I hope you will enjoy Hoverflow, <strong>my first big project</strong> \ud83d\udda4<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280060/extras/16a9e1ad1c0e6da0fbee27dfd2b7df1b.webp?t=1758041219\" width=616 height=35 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280060/extras/a9f459d8c74646123fb4364c5d41cca6.poster.avif?t=1758041219\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280060/extras/a9f459d8c74646123fb4364c5d41cca6.webm?t=1758041219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280060/extras/a9f459d8c74646123fb4364c5d41cca6.mp4?t=1758041219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Inspired from the famous mod from Counter Strike, surf on all kinds of ramps ! <strong>Intuitive tutorials</strong> will help you learn and master this <strong>unique mechanic</strong> and <strong>cool audio design</strong> makes it even more fun !<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280060/extras/ee9db390ed659ee29bb0547c3b4d3799.webp?t=1758041219\" width=616 height=35 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280060/extras/dc832cf1d9941ef131328bf5cc026a55.poster.avif?t=1758041219\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280060/extras/dc832cf1d9941ef131328bf5cc026a55.webm?t=1758041219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280060/extras/dc832cf1d9941ef131328bf5cc026a55.mp4?t=1758041219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Jump</strong>, <strong>double jump</strong>, and <strong>even bunny hops</strong> if you have enough speed ! Use them all and chose wisely your timing to <strong>keep your flow</strong> !<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280060/extras/4bed31b152c619017360c08886ec8a1a.webp?t=1758041219\" width=616 height=35 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280060/extras/ba47ec1617c433f288c099d0a4aa0e11.poster.avif?t=1758041219\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280060/extras/ba47ec1617c433f288c099d0a4aa0e11.webm?t=1758041219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280060/extras/ba47ec1617c433f288c099d0a4aa0e11.mp4?t=1758041219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Take the time to enjoy beautiful watercolor textures and a <strong>mysterious atmosphere</strong> alongside a peaceful <strong>35 minutes long soundtrack</strong>. Don't forget to explore the world to <strong>uncover secrets</strong>... be careful though, some might try to escape ! <strong>Hidden characters</strong> might reveal a thing or two about the world you live in as well...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280060/extras/ce0b7f6068da23352739a3913fb53517.webp?t=1758041219\" width=616 height=35 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280060/extras/214f7093b672a029dded99d76b204a49.poster.avif?t=1758041219\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280060/extras/214f7093b672a029dded99d76b204a49.webm?t=1758041219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280060/extras/214f7093b672a029dded99d76b204a49.mp4?t=1758041219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Beat quickly the <strong>30+ handcrafted levels</strong> to earn medals from <strong>Bronze to Gold</strong>... or even <strong>try to beat my time</strong> if you have what it takes ! Compare your times with your friends on <strong>leaderboards </strong>as well !<br><br>Join the Discord if you have any question, I usually answer pretty quickly !<br>Simon.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Comet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1280060/95810ca2d4aa4d03d9c387e77267bae2b52a4498.jpg"},{"name":"Rising Pilgrim","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1280060/22bb1ac4fbdb0f230e9b73ab91738f5fc8662ba0.jpg"},{"name":"The last Limbo Keeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1280060/4a4cc22095494549f7600efa320134e7eb770ee7.jpg"},{"name":"Hover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1280060/f38f3cff9edfb3ad2e681afc1a4efe161e72b763.jpg"},{"name":"Grounded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1280060/941ef6d4241961c7df8342fa94eceab514638052.jpg"},{"name":"Hops and Dreams","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1280060/a723fe52b2b1695222956108839c7ab8f8b00cbb.jpg"},{"name":"Blue Shift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1280060/d24ecd007a9830a6223d7237d776c168d45c78d7.jpg"},{"name":"To infinity and beyond","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/im